# Lacerate Flesh: 4 damage to Llanowar Elves (1/1). Lethal before the
# damage is 1 (GameAction.java:2750-2752, Card.getExcessDamageValue), so 3
# is excess (CR 120.10). The Elves are the spell's target, so
# ExcessSVarCondition$ Card.targetedBy holds (CardProperty.java:271-277) and
# CardDamageTable.triggerExcessDamage stores 3 as the spell's SVar X
# (CardDamageTable.java:136-155); the Token link reads TokenAmount$ X and
# makes three Blood tokens.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
tapformana human 6 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets 7
queue action human cast 1
passpriority
